    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/40c7c47edc552df19a851cfd92507e49.avif?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Reaver is a Multiplayer Co-op, Round-based, First-person shooter. Set in a dark fantasy world, the player steps into the boots of the Nameless Blood Reaver, the ultimate soldier of a dying legion. Prevening an invasion from the forces of hell using heavy metal weaponry, otherworldly oddities, and ancient blood magic to slay relentless hordes of demons.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/9959c9869a7480b257c46ad311009a2f.webp?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=49 /></span>Gather your friends to take on the forces of hell. Play Solo or with up to 4 friends to work together to rediscover the history of the Blood Reavers and end the demonic invasion.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/2349f6f10e72f532068c319dd1a3e31e.poster.avif?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/2349f6f10e72f532068c319dd1a3e31e.webm?t=1754665386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/61b3d3106f831d3a3b2ab628daf00803.webp?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=49 /></span>Experience everything you love about the wave-shooter genre, including classic mechanics, a gameplay-first philosophy, and in-round progression. Blood Reaver expands the genre with all-new mechanics, including a revamped combat system, blood magic abilities, and long-term progression!  <br><br>Hunt for secrets and easter eggs to uncover the dark, rich lore behind the world of Blood Reaver, exploring mysteries deep beyond the gates of hell\u2026 and perhaps ever deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/db5bd87fa9ddc2fa961ef615fba08638.poster.avif?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/db5bd87fa9ddc2fa961ef615fba08638.webm?t=1754665386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/ef70bd38ce13c9004de8dd62b3c0b0af.webp?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Harvest your enemies:</strong> Use heavy metal weapons to harvest the blood of demons, infuse your abilities and unleash the full power of a Blood Reaver.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Create devastating synergies:</strong> Execute demons with the finest of what Bartov\u2019s arsenal has to offer, massacring hordes with 26 unique weapons and abilities.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Master forgotten magic:</strong> Get up close and personal with the ancient oddities of the Blood Reaver Knights.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/71ca13ec04f55da715ec224bab6b5261.poster.avif?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/71ca13ec04f55da715ec224bab6b5261.webm?t=1754665386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/e9dfc5314917bc86228e85aa88a6f86e.webp?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=49 /></span>Use the materials wrested from your demonic foes to upgrade your spells and equipment. Create formidable variants of your abilities, and carry newly crafted relics into battle to turn the tides against the minions of hell.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/b2f8ca50ff7d84fc4fe41e455e6f6782.poster.avif?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/b2f8ca50ff7d84fc4fe41e455e6f6782.webm?t=1754665386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/6467e15208b21bd57f40d287237d36c3.webp?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=49 /></span>Slaughter endless demons in a series of locations, following our champions as you discover the secrets to stopping the demonic invasion. Each map features unique mechanics and challenges, blood magic abilities, legendary weapons, and special enemy types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/692827ac4c3f2ec769f111aa590ed773.poster.avif?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/692827ac4c3f2ec769f111aa590ed773.webm?t=1754665386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/5f5a296fa5f5f9120cb60a632179c65c.webp?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/40c7c47edc552df19a851cfd92507e49.avif?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Reaver is a Multiplayer Co-op, Round-based, First-person shooter. Set in a dark fantasy world, the player steps into the boots of the Nameless Blood Reaver, the ultimate soldier of a dying legion. Prevening an invasion from the forces of hell using heavy metal weaponry, otherworldly oddities, and ancient blood magic to slay relentless hordes of demons.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/9959c9869a7480b257c46ad311009a2f.webp?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=49 /></span>Gather your friends to take on the forces of hell. Play Solo or with up to 4 friends to work together to rediscover the history of the Blood Reavers and end the demonic invasion.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/2349f6f10e72f532068c319dd1a3e31e.poster.avif?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/2349f6f10e72f532068c319dd1a3e31e.webm?t=1754665386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/61b3d3106f831d3a3b2ab628daf00803.webp?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=49 /></span>Experience everything you love about the wave-shooter genre, including classic mechanics, a gameplay-first philosophy, and in-round progression. Blood Reaver expands the genre with all-new mechanics, including a revamped combat system, blood magic abilities, and long-term progression!  <br><br>Hunt for secrets and easter eggs to uncover the dark, rich lore behind the world of Blood Reaver, exploring mysteries deep beyond the gates of hell\u2026 and perhaps ever deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/db5bd87fa9ddc2fa961ef615fba08638.poster.avif?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/db5bd87fa9ddc2fa961ef615fba08638.webm?t=1754665386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/ef70bd38ce13c9004de8dd62b3c0b0af.webp?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Harvest your enemies:</strong> Use heavy metal weapons to harvest the blood of demons, infuse your abilities and unleash the full power of a Blood Reaver.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Create devastating synergies:</strong> Execute demons with the finest of what Bartov\u2019s arsenal has to offer, massacring hordes with 26 unique weapons and abilities.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Master forgotten magic:</strong> Get up close and personal with the ancient oddities of the Blood Reaver Knights.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/71ca13ec04f55da715ec224bab6b5261.poster.avif?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/71ca13ec04f55da715ec224bab6b5261.webm?t=1754665386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/e9dfc5314917bc86228e85aa88a6f86e.webp?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=49 /></span>Use the materials wrested from your demonic foes to upgrade your spells and equipment. Create formidable variants of your abilities, and carry newly crafted relics into battle to turn the tides against the minions of hell.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/b2f8ca50ff7d84fc4fe41e455e6f6782.poster.avif?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/b2f8ca50ff7d84fc4fe41e455e6f6782.webm?t=1754665386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/6467e15208b21bd57f40d287237d36c3.webp?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=49 /></span>Slaughter endless demons in a series of locations, following our champions as you discover the secrets to stopping the demonic invasion. Each map features unique mechanics and challenges, blood magic abilities, legendary weapons, and special enemy types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/692827ac4c3f2ec769f111aa590ed773.poster.avif?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/692827ac4c3f2ec769f111aa590ed773.webm?t=1754665386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906070/extras/5f5a296fa5f5f9120cb60a632179c65c.webp?t=1754665386\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p>",
